[{"text": "And now I give the floor to his", "start": 1.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "excellency Mktar Tilo Berdi, Minister", "start": 3.12, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "for Foreign Affairs of Kazakhstan.", "start": 7.04, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "Mr. President, distinguished delegates,", "start": 28.16, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "I congratulate his excellency, Mr. Halur", "start": 32.719, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Rahman on his election as the president", "start": 35.92, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of the 81st session of the general", "start": 38.879, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "assembly and assure him that he can", "start": 41.92, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "count on Kazan full support throughout", "start": 44.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "this session.", "start": 48.719, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Excellencies, Kazastan remains fully", "start": 50.8, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "committed to the pupils and principles", "start": 53.92, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "of the charter of the United Nations and", "start": 56.719, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "to effective multilateral cooperation.", "start": 60.239, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Guided by pragmatic and proactive", "start": 63.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "foreign policy, we continue our efforts", "start": 66.08, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "to strengthen international peace and", "start": 68.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "security and to advance pragmatic", "start": 71.76, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "solutions to our shared global", "start": 74.479, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "challenges.", "start": 77.119, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "For Kazakhstan, multilateralism is a key", "start": 78.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "instrument for building trust, finding", "start": 81.92, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "common ground, and delivering results", "start": 84.88, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "for our citizens and future generations.", "start": 87.6, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "It's a key component of our own", "start": 92.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "long-term social economic development.", "start": 94.24, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Kazakhstan has embarked on profound", "start": 98.159, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "political transformation in response to", "start": 100.96, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "societal demand and emerging challenges.", "start": 105.04, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Our new constitution reinforces the", "start": 108.64, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "foundations of national sustainable", "start": 111.68, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "development by placing greater emphasis", "start": 114.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "on human dignity, human capital,", "start": 117.119, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "education, innovation and environmental", "start": 120.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "responsibility.", "start": 123.6, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "I have also continued to strengthen the", "start": 125.28, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "rule of law, public accountability and", "start": 129.119, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "protection of human rights. Elections", "start": 132.64, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "last month to the new coralai brought", "start": 136.239, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "into unicameal parliament and diverse", "start": 139.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "set of voices including historic high", "start": 142.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "34% of women.", "start": 145.76, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Mr. President, we express our country's", "start": 149.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "grave concern as the world continues its", "start": 152.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "slight toward uncertainty and division.", "start": 155.36, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The erosion of trust among nations is", "start": 159.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "rapidly reshaping the international", "start": 162.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "order. Our collective inability to", "start": 164.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "prevent conflicts, our collective", "start": 168.16, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "indifference toward humanitarian crisis", "start": 170.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "and our collective reluctance to seek", "start": 173.599, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "common solutions to shared challenges", "start": 177.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "are all becoming normalized.", "start": 180.319, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "Trust cannot be restored when", "start": 183.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "international law is applied.", "start": 186.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "selectively and commitments remain", "start": 188.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "unfulfilled.", "start": 191.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Our response must be grounded in the", "start": 193.28, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "fundamental values we have affirmed", "start": 195.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "together. Freedom, equality, justice,", "start": 198.159, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "and respect for human dignity. President", "start": 201.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Okayaf has repeatedly underscored the", "start": 204.959, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "indispensable role of the United Nations", "start": 207.519, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "as a single universal platform uniquely", "start": 210.4, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "capable of bringing the states together", "start": 213.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to address the challenges we face.", "start": 216.319, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "But to feel its potential, U must be", "start": 219.519, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "able to act, adapt and deliver. We fully", "start": 223.04, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "support the UN at initiative. The", "start": 226.799, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "success of the reform should be measured", "start": 230.72, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "not by what is cut or re reorganized,", "start": 233.28, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "but by whether the United Nations", "start": 237.2, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "prevents conflicts more effectively,", "start": 239.439, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "responds more rapidly to crisis, and", "start": 242.159, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "delivers better results for all member", "start": 244.959, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "states.", "start": 248.319, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Central to this renewal is reform of the", "start": 250.4, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "security council. Broader representation", "start": 253.36, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "of Asia, Africa and Latin America in the", "start": 256.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "council as well as greater voice for", "start": 259.519, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "developing countries and for middle", "start": 262.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "powers is a moral imperative.", "start": 264.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Equitable geographical representation", "start": 268.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "must apply throughout the United Nations", "start": 270.72, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "system as a condition of legitimacy and", "start": 273.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "credibility.", "start": 276.96, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "The selection of the next secretary", "start": 278.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "general will be one of the defining", "start": 280.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "moment of this session and Kazakhstan", "start": 283.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "supports a transparent, inclusive and", "start": 286.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "merit-basing process conducted in full", "start": 289.52, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "accordance with the chapter.", "start": 292.08, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Mr. President, the international", "start": 295.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "security environment continues to", "start": 297.199, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "deteriorate.", "start": 300.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "World military expenditures reached a", "start": 302.08, "duration": 8.64}, {"text": "record $2.9 trillion dollar in 2025.", "start": 305.44, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "Our small planet is home to more than", "start": 310.72, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "12,000 nuclear weapons, each one capable", "start": 313.52, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "of untold damage and sorrow. Every year", "start": 317.68, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "we seem to lose more biodiversity yet", "start": 321.039, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "gain more armaments.", "start": 324.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "For Kazakhstan, nuclear disarmament in", "start": 327.44, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "particular is not an abstract doctrine.", "start": 329.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It's a responsibility born on national", "start": 332.32, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "experience.", "start": 336.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "This year marks 35 years since the", "start": 337.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "closure of the Cip Palatin nuclear test", "start": 340.72, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "site, 30 years since the CTBT opened for", "start": 343.039, "duration": 7.761}, {"text": "signature and 20 years since the signing", "start": 346.88, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "of the C Palatin treaty on nuclear", "start": 350.8, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "weapon free zone in Central Asia. Our", "start": 353.84, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "experience uh of reannouncing the world", "start": 357.84, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "fourth largest nuclear arsenal did not", "start": 361.6, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "weaken our state. To the contrary", "start": 365.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "through international trust it", "start": 368.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "strengthens sovereignity, enhance", "start": 370.639, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "security and promotes development.", "start": 373.039, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Today the trust is again in danger. New", "start": 376.08, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "start has expired while the 2026 NPT", "start": 379.039, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "review conference ended without", "start": 383.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "substantive outcome for the third", "start": 386.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "consecutive cycle. Nuclear weapon states", "start": 388.08, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "must never confuse the absence of", "start": 391.919, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "agreement with vacuum of obligation.", "start": 394.16, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "They remain responsible until we secure", "start": 397.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "world free of nuclear weapons.", "start": 400.96, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Kazakhstan advocates the relaunch of", "start": 404.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "high level dialogue among nuclear powers", "start": 407.039, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "and is ready to host one of their next", "start": 410.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "meetings. We will also continue", "start": 412.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "advancing our earlier proposal to", "start": 415.44, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "strengthen the BWC through establishing", "start": 417.919, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "an international agency for biological", "start": 421.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "security.", "start": 425.52, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates, peace and", "start": 427.84, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "stability are prerequisite for", "start": 429.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "sustainable development. We stand firmly", "start": 432.479, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "for diplomacy and dialogue and against", "start": 435.44, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the escalation of tension and the use of", "start": 439.039, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "force. We remain deeply concerned about", "start": 441.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Ukrainian crisis which continues to take", "start": 444.56, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "lives, erode global trust and undermine", "start": 447.68, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "international security.", "start": 451.52, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "Even the most difficult conflicts must", "start": 453.919, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "ultimately be resolved through diplomacy", "start": 456.639, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and negotiation.", "start": 459.52, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Beyond the tragic loss of life,", "start": 461.919, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "Kazakhstan strongly condemns the", "start": 463.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "repeated drone attacks against Kazak", "start": 466.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "crude oil export infrastructure,", "start": 469.199, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "including against commercial vessels in", "start": 471.84, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "the Black Sea basin.", "start": 474.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Such incidents endangered civilian", "start": 476.879, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "navigation, disrupt international trade", "start": 480.16, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "and threatened the stability of global", "start": 483.44, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "energy supplies.", "start": 485.52, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "We call on We call on all parties to", "start": 488.879, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "uphold international law and take all", "start": 492.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "necessary measures to protect critical", "start": 494.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "infrastructure and ensure the safety and", "start": 496.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "continuity of civilian commerce.", "start": 499.52, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Political and diplomatic means remain", "start": 502.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the only viable path towards ending", "start": 505.039, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "hostilities and achieving sustainable", "start": 508.4, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "resolution of the Middle East crisis.", "start": 510.96, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "The ongoing escalation carries serious", "start": 514.959, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "implications for regional and", "start": 517.519, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "international peace and security as well", "start": 519.36, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "as for economic stability, transport", "start": 522.08, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "connectivity and energy security. A just", "start": 524.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "as lasting peace in the Middle East", "start": 528.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "requires an independent, sovereign, and", "start": 531.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "viable state of Palestine living side by", "start": 533.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "side with Israel in peace and security.", "start": 537.12, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "We support the new the New York", "start": 541.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "declaration as a framework of for", "start": 543.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "tangible, time bound and irreversible", "start": 546.24, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "steps toward this two-state solution.", "start": 549.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "My country stands ready to support every", "start": 553.6, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "effort aimed at the maintaining", "start": 556.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "unhindered humanitarian assistance,", "start": 558.72, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "protection of civilians and recovery of", "start": 561.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Gaza. Kazan's", "start": 565.76, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "calls for the full and goodfaith", "start": 568.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "implementation of the comprehensive plan", "start": 571.12, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "to end the Gaza conflict and security", "start": 573.44, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "council resolution 2803.", "start": 576.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "As a member of the board of peace,", "start": 580.48, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "President Okive has committed the", "start": 582.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "contribute to the stabilization of Gaza", "start": 584.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "by supporting civilian reconstruction,", "start": 587.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "ensuring food security and providing", "start": 590.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "digital government solution.", "start": 593.04, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "Kazan's peacekeepers in Yundov and", "start": 595.76, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "UNIFIL reflect our readiness to assume", "start": 600.08, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "practical responsibility and contribute", "start": 603.68, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "to the international mandated", "start": 606.399, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "stabilization forces in Gaza. Kazan", "start": 608.16, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "formally announced its intention to join", "start": 612.64, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "the Abraham eccorts. We see them as an", "start": 615.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "additional platform to infor reinforce", "start": 619.279, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "the UN brokered political process", "start": 622.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "towards the two-state solution.", "start": 625.44, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "The long-term stability of Afghanistan", "start": 628.399, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "remains inseparable from the security", "start": 631.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and sustainable development of Central", "start": 634.399, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "Asia. Humanitarian assistance remains", "start": 637.2, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "indispensable but it cannot be itself", "start": 641.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "break the cycle of poverty, displacement", "start": 644.56, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "and dependency. Kazakhstan supports", "start": 648.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "pragmatic, coordinated and step-by-step", "start": 651.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "international engagement with", "start": 654.0, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Afghanistan with the UN playing the", "start": 656.0, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "central role. Finally, we have watched", "start": 658.959, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "with growing concern in the recent years", "start": 662.64, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "the erosion of pro protection of", "start": 665.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "civilians in conflict zones", "start": 667.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "in response together with Brazil, China,", "start": 670.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "France, Jordan, South Africa and the", "start": 673.36, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "ICRC. Kazakhstan is advancing the global", "start": 676.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "initiative to galvanize political", "start": 679.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "commitment to international humanitarian", "start": 682.56, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "law. Mr. President, the growing role of", "start": 685.68, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "middle powers in global affairs is", "start": 689.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "opening new avenues for practical", "start": 691.519, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "cooperation to achieve SDGs. Kazakhstan", "start": 694.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "is working with the United Nations to", "start": 697.6, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "operationalize the United Nations", "start": 700.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "regional center for the sustainable", "start": 702.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "development goals for Central Asia and", "start": 705.76, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "Afghanistan in Almati City. Its success", "start": 708.32, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "should be measured by what it delivers.", "start": 712.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "I thank my colleagues, the foreign", "start": 716.24, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "ministers of Central Asia, for helping", "start": 718.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "shape a practical and focused agenda for", "start": 720.48, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the center. Reaffirming our commitment", "start": 723.6, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "advancing primary health care as the", "start": 727.36, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "cornerstone of universal health", "start": 730.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "coverage, we call upon UN member states", "start": 733.44, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "to join the global coalition on primary", "start": 736.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "health care.", "start": 739.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "2026 has been", "start": 741.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "designated by this body as the", "start": 744.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "international year of voluntary", "start": 746.639, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "volunteers for sustainable development.", "start": 750.0, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "This initiative originally at President", "start": 753.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Stokay's suggestion has given new", "start": 756.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "impetus to volunteerism", "start": 758.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "as a force for stronger communities", "start": 761.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "youth engagement and environmental", "start": 764.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "action in Kazakhstan and elsewhere.", "start": 767.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Hundreds or thousands of people have", "start": 770.56, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "joined volunteer activities.", "start": 772.8, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Excellencies, environmental challenges", "start": 776.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "are among the defining issues of our", "start": 778.639, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "time. Climate change, biodiversity loss,", "start": 781.2, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "land degradation and the growing", "start": 784.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "frequency of natural disaster are", "start": 787.519, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "placing increasing pressure on our", "start": 790.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "societies and economies.", "start": 792.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "The regional ecological summit held in", "start": 796.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Dana in April reaffirming that climate,", "start": 798.399, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "water, food and health challenges cannot", "start": 801.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "be addressed in isolation.", "start": 804.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Its declaration environmental solidarity", "start": 808.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "of Central Asia provides a strong", "start": 810.88, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "foundation for advancing regional", "start": 813.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "cooperation on environmental protection", "start": 815.44, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and sustainable development.", "start": 817.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "On the same day, the heads of states of", "start": 820.639, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "the founding countries of the", "start": 822.959, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "international fund for saving the RLC", "start": 825.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "declared an international day of RLC and", "start": 828.32, "duration": 7.759}, {"text": "Amudara and Saria rivers with the aim of", "start": 831.76, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "raising global awareness of the region's", "start": 836.079, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "environmental challenges and mobilizing", "start": 839.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "greater international support for their", "start": 841.519, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "preservation.", "start": 844.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "We are grateful for the support of UN", "start": 846.079, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "member states and partners for President", "start": 849.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "Okive's proposal to proclaim 22nd April", "start": 851.76, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "as the international day of greening of", "start": 855.44, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "the planet aimed at amplifying global", "start": 859.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "efforts to restore ecosystem.", "start": 862.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Kazakhstan pursues a human centered", "start": 865.839, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "approach to contemporary challenges", "start": 869.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "emphasizing peaceuilding, dialogue and", "start": 872.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "cooperation as an essential response to", "start": 875.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "the complex global challenges of our", "start": 878.56, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "time. This approach is underpinned by", "start": 880.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "broader mental shift toward", "start": 885.12, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "environmental stewardship, civic", "start": 887.279, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "engagement and care for the public good.", "start": 889.68, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "It's reflected in nationwide efforts to", "start": 893.92, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "improve public spaces, advance largecale", "start": 896.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "greening, and promote the values of", "start": 899.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "respect for the rule of law, active and", "start": 902.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "responsible patriotism,", "start": 905.04, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "volunteerism and compassion as integral", "start": 907.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "element of everyday life and civic", "start": 911.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "culture. This bring us to another", "start": 914.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "critical topic of our days. Healthy", "start": 917.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "ecosystem depend on water. Water", "start": 920.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "security is fundamental to the", "start": 923.199, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "well-being and the resilience of our", "start": 925.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "societies.", "start": 928.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Water underpins public health, food and", "start": 930.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "energy security, climate resilience and", "start": 934.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "peace. Yet, despite its fundamental", "start": 937.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "importance, global water governance", "start": 940.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "remains fragmented. The recent", "start": 942.8, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "devastating floods in the mountains", "start": 945.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "regions of Nepal and China remind us of", "start": 948.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "the growing risk associated with water", "start": 951.68, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "and climate related disasters. In this", "start": 954.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "context, President Tokay has proposed", "start": 957.92, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "the establishment of international water", "start": 960.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "organization under the oices of the", "start": 963.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "United Nations. The pupils is to make", "start": 966.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international water governance more", "start": 969.36, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "coherent, accountable and capable of", "start": 971.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "effective implementation.", "start": 974.639, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Kazakhstan's calls for inclusive member", "start": 976.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "state-led process to explore options for", "start": 980.639, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "strengthening the institutional", "start": 983.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "architecture for water within the United", "start": 985.519, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 988.32, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "We will continue to advance this", "start": 990.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "discussion in the leadup for the 2026", "start": 992.639, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "United Nations Water Conference in Abu", "start": 996.48, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Dhabi. Kazapstan stands ready to work", "start": 999.279, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "with the all member states and partners", "start": 1002.079, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "to advance this common agenda.", "start": 1004.399, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Distinguished delegates, artificial", "start": 1007.759, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "intelligence and rapid technological", "start": 1010.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "change present another area where urgent", "start": 1013.04, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "international cooperation is needed. At", "start": 1015.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "home, we are investing uh computing", "start": 1019.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "capacity, digital infrastructure and AI", "start": 1021.199, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "skills. We are forging new trusted", "start": 1024.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "partnership on AI governance and", "start": 1027.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "emerging technologies. And we have", "start": 1030.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "recently adopted law on artificial", "start": 1032.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "intelligence and new digital code. But", "start": 1035.199, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "without effective governance at all", "start": 1038.799, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "levels, it will also deepen inequality,", "start": 1041.679, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "create new security risk. as we have", "start": 1045.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "seen very recently and widen the digital", "start": 1048.4, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "divide.", "start": 1051.84, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "We also should not let ethical norms", "start": 1053.76, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "fall behind this rapid evolution. AI", "start": 1056.799, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "must remain human centered, safe and", "start": 1060.559, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "subject to meaningful human oversight.", "start": 1063.36, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "These risks are particularly serious in", "start": 1067.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "the military domain where the use of AI", "start": 1069.679, "duration": 7.441}, {"text": "in warfare and cyber operations could", "start": 1073.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "have farreaching consequences for", "start": 1077.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "international stability. Kazakhstan", "start": 1079.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "supports stronger international rules", "start": 1081.84, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "and cooperation, including through the", "start": 1084.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "United Nations global mechanism on ICT", "start": 1086.799, "duration": 7.521}, {"text": "security and UN global dialogue on AI", "start": 1090.4, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "governance. At the regional level, we", "start": 1094.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "invite partners to engage with the", "start": 1097.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "UNESCOP Asia-Pacific Digital Solution", "start": 1099.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Center in Almati City as a platform for", "start": 1102.64, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "sharing expertise and advancing regional", "start": 1105.76, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "digital cooperation.", "start": 1108.96, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, one thing is", "start": 1111.679, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "clear. There is a global trust deficit.", "start": 1114.48, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Restoring trust will take time. But", "start": 1117.52, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "greater trust will not just appear like", "start": 1120.799, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "magic. It's a result of increasing not", "start": 1123.44, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "decreasing international cooperation and", "start": 1126.72, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "we must build it. The system of", "start": 1129.919, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international cooperation we call", "start": 1133.039, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "multilateralism", "start": 1134.799, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "in whose famous hall we stand today", "start": 1136.64, "duration": 9.279}, {"text": "depends on us just as we depend on it", "start": 1141.28, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "through the institution of m", "start": 1145.919, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "multiritalism must deliver tangible", "start": 1148.08, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "benefits but equally true we the member", "start": 1150.96, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "states must honor our commitments", "start": 1155.2, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "adhere to global standards and work", "start": 1158.559, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Together, Kazakhstan will remain", "start": 1161.36, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "reliable partner for peace, security,", "start": 1164.16, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and sustainable development. We will", "start": 1166.559, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "continue to choose cooperation over", "start": 1169.44, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "coordination and work with all member", "start": 1171.919, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "states to strengthen the United Nations", "start": 1174.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and turn our shared commitments into", "start": 1178.08, "duration": 8.28}, {"text": "meaningful action. And I thank you.", "start": 1181.2, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": ">> I thank you. I thank the Minister for", "start": 1187.28, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "Foreign Affairs of Kazakhstan.", "start": 1189.76, "duration": 4.36}]